      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Transaction Coordination Agent\n\n**TENEX Equivalent:** Tester Agent validating implementation against requirements\n\n**Core Function:** Manages the 30 administrative hours per transaction. Tracks deadlines, coordinates documents, and ensures nothing falls through the cracks from contract to close.\n\n## Trigger Events\n- Contract executed\n- Option period start\n- Inspection scheduled\n- Financing deadline\n\n## Success Metrics\n- On-time closings\n- Deadline compliance rate\n- Document turnaround time\n- Agent hours saved",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-200, -200],
      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "Agent Overview"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Credentials to Configure\n\n1. `GOOGLE_SHEETS_CREDENTIAL_ID` → Transaction tracking sheet\n2. `GMAIL_CREDENTIAL_ID` → Gmail OAuth2\n3. `OPENROUTER_CREDENTIAL_ID` → AI for document generation\n4. `GOOGLE_DRIVE_CREDENTIAL_ID` → Document storage\n5. `TWILIO_CREDENTIAL_ID` → SMS alerts\n\n## Sheet Structure\n- Transaction ID, Property Address, Client Name\n- Contract Date, Option Period End, Financing Deadline\n- Inspection Date, Appraisal Date, Closing Date\n- Status, Agent, Notes",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 5
      },
