        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "=<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px;\">\n  <h2>Congratulations on Your Contract!</h2>\n  \n  <p>Dear {{ $('Normalize Transaction Data').item.json.client_name }},</p>\n  \n  <p>I'm excited to help guide you through the purchase of <strong>{{ $('Normalize Transaction Data').item.json.property_address }}</strong>!</p>\n  \n  <h3>Key Dates to Remember:</h3>\n  <ul>\n    <li><strong>Contract Date:</strong> {{ $('Normalize Transaction Data').item.json.contract_date }}</li>\n    <li><strong>Option Period Ends:</strong> {{ $('Normalize Transaction Data').item.json.option_period_end }}</li>\n    <li><strong>Financing Deadline:</strong> {{ $('Normalize Transaction Data').item.json.financing_deadline }}</li>\n    <li><strong>Closing Date:</strong> {{ $('Normalize Transaction Data').item.json.closing_date }}</li>\n  </ul>\n  \n  <h3>What Happens Next:</h3>\n  <ol>\n    <li>Earnest money deposit (within 3 days)</li>\n    <li>Schedule home inspection</li>\n    <li>Appraisal ordered by lender</li>\n    <li>Title work in progress</li>\n    <li>Final walkthrough before closing</li>\n  </ol>\n  \n  <p>I'll keep you updated at every step. Please don't hesitate to reach out with any questions!</p>\n  \n  <p>Best regards,<br>YOUR_AGENT_NAME</p>\n</div>",
